                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>Key takeaway</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='10'>
The three relationships differ substantially. Urbanization shows the clearest positive association with NCD mortality change, while GDP per capita and health expenditure show weaker negative relationships.</run>
